title Vinyl: CJK names and tags (Japanese, Chinese, Korean) on now playing and in the browser, through the launcher's Noto Sans CJK, at 640x480
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm) leaves the approved 640x480 layout's touch rows 70 px, under the 7 mm (79 px):
# owner rule R-4, listed in qa-info.txt; the scene runs at a 3.5-inch 640x480 panel's 9.01 px/mm (the harness's own
# 480x640), whose 7 mm (63 px) the rows hold, the toolkit header as on the deck (56 px)
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_CJK 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot 01-now-cjk
expect esc
expect text "あの夏へ"
expect text "久石譲"
key b
wait 400
shot 02-browser-cjk
expect text "한국"
expect text "月亮代表我的心"
tap "한국"
wait 400
shot 03-browser-cjk-folder
expect text "서른 즈음에"
expect noquit
